OL,3,GNEWSA'You've got to live your life',
OL,4,Asays cancer fundraiser after own
OL,5,Adiagnosis
OL,6,
OL,7,FA cancer charity fundraiser who has
OL,8,Flost many members of his family to the
OL,9,Fdisease has said this year's Christmas
OL,10,Fcampaign will be particularly "special"
OL,11,Fas he will need the organisation's
OL,12,Fsupport himself following his own
OL,13,Fdiagnosis.
OL,15,FPaul Bottomley, 59, from Sowerby
OL,16,FBridge, said he had assumed frequent
OL,17,Furination through the night was down to
OL,18,Fhis age, but is now due to have his
OL,19,Fprostate removed after his cancer
OL,20,Fdiagnosis.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
