OL,3,GNEWSA'You've got to live your life',
OL,4,Asays cancer fundraiser after own
OL,5,Adiagnosis
OL,6,
OL,7,FPaul has already lost his mother,
OL,8,Ffather, brother and sister to cancer -
OL,9,Fand his wife Jane began treatment 14
OL,10,Fyears ago after a tumour was found on
OL,11,Fher ovary.
OL,13,FWhen Jane began chemotherapy in
OL,14,FHalifax, Paul started a Christmas
OL,15,Fhamper raffle, known as Super Hampers,
OL,16,Fto give something back to Calderdale
OL,17,FRoyal Hospital.
